Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0 : Screen Display 0,144,60,320,200
Ink 2 : Polygon 12,0 To 23,8 To 12,15 To 0,8 To 12,0 : Paint 12,8 : Get Bob 1,0,0 To 32,16
Cls 0 : Ink 3 : Bar 0,0 To 2,2 : Get Bob 2,0,0 To 16,3
Cls 0 : Ink 4 : Circle 20,20,18 : Get Bob 3,0,0 To 48,40
Cls 0 : Make Mask : Update Off
Bob 1,100,80,1
A$="" : For X=90 To 130 : Bob 2,X,84,2 : A$=A$+Chr$(48-Bob Col(2)) : Next X : Print #1,A$
A$="" : For Y=74 To 100 : Bob 2,110,Y,2 : A$=A$+Chr$(48-Bob Col(2)) : Next Y : Print #1,A$
Hot Spot 2,1,1 : A$="" : For X=90 To 130 : Bob 2,X,88,2 : A$=A$+Chr$(48-Bob Col(1)) : Next X : Print #1,A$
Bob 3,95,70,3 : Bob 4,200,100,1 : Bob 5,99,79,2 : Bob 6,115,90,2
Print #1,Bob Col(1);Col(2);Col(3);Col(4);Col(5);Col(6);Col(-1);Col(-4);Col(-6);Col(-300)
Print #1,Bob Col(1,3 To 4);Col(2);Col(3);Col(5)
Print #1,Bob Col(3,1 To 6);Col(1);Col(5);Col(6);Bob Col(4);Bob Col(9)
Sprite 1,254,144,2 : Sprite 2,300,200,2 : Sprite 3,250,140,1
Print #1,Sprite Col(1);Col(2);Col(3);Sprite Col(1,3 To 3);Sprite Col(2);Sprite Col(70)
Print #1,Spritebob Col(1);Col(1);Col(2);Col(3);Col(4);Col(5)
Print #1,Spritebob Col(3,1 To 2);Col(1);Col(2)
Print #1,Bobsprite Col(1);Col(1);Col(2);Col(3);Bobsprite Col(4)
Screen Open 1,640,100,4,Hires : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0 : Screen Display 1,128,180,640,30
Bob 7,200,10,2
Screen 0
A$="" : For X=216 To 244 : Sprite 4,X,191,2 : A$=A$+Chr$(48-Spritebob Col(4,7 To 7)) : Next X : Print #1,A$
A$="" : For X=216 To 244 : Sprite 4,X,191,2 : A$=A$+Chr$(48-Bobsprite Col(7,4 To 4)) : Next X : Print #1,A$
Print #1,"end"
